---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { AUTHOR } from '@/data/author';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with saasmath." pathname="/contact">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-10 prose-tight">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Email is the fastest way to reach me.</p>
    <p><a href={`mailto:${AUTHOR.email}`}>{AUTHOR.email}</a></p>

    <h2>What I read</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Formula corrections. I take these seriously. Please include a source.</li>
      <li>Requests for new calculators. Tell me the exact question you're trying to answer.</li>
      <li>Guest post pitches from operators or investors. No content agencies.</li>
      <li>Partnership inquiries from SaaS tools relevant to founder finance.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What I don't read</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>SEO service offers.</li>
      <li>Link exchange requests.</li>
      <li>Anything auto-generated.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Response time is usually 1–3 business days.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
